cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Thymos in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "Thymos: A Local-First Memory Control Plane Coupling Forgetting, Affect, Endocrine Modulation and Environment"
abstract: >-
  Thymos is a research-grade memory control plane for LLM agents. It couples an
  FSRS-style forgetting curve, appraisal-based affect, an eight-variable
  endocrine layer, and weather/light coupling in one deterministic, inspectable
  state, then routes facts, episodes, graph neighbours and schema summaries under
  an explicit context budget with an audit trace.
authors:
  - name: "Thymos contributors"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/agentforgehu/thymos-engine"
keywords:
  - affective computing
  - memory
  - forgetting curve
  - FSRS
  - ACT-R
  - endocrine
  - memory control plane
  - context routing
  - agent
